    "Elixir of the Frostwyrm": `One use only. The bearer gains a Strength 4 Breath Weapon with the Ice Attacks special rule. However, after using it they automatically suffer a Wound with no saves allowed. Common.`,
    "Frost-Talon Shardbolts": `Hunter with Harpoon Launcher only. All shots fired by their weapon have the Ice Attacks and Magical Attacks special rules. Common.`,
    "Grease-Smeared Tusks": `Butcher or Slaughtermaster only. All friendly Monstrous Beasts, Monstrous Creatures and Monsters within 12" gain +1 to their Movement. Common.`,
