    "Flask of Stonehorn Blood": `One use only. At the start of any of your turns, all attacks targeting the bearer must re-roll successful rolls To Wound for the duration of this turn. Common.`,
    "Ogre Tooth": `Honcho only. One use only. At the start of any of your turns, roll a D6. On a 1 the bearer is removed as a casualty. On a 2+, the character and any Gnoblar unit within 6" gains Immunity (Psychology) until the start of your next turn. Common.`,
    "Skullmantle": `Butcher or Slaughtermaster only. Any enemy unit forced to take any Leadership tests due to the bearer or a unit they have joined suffers a -1 penalty to their Leadership. Common.`,
    "Fistful of Laurels": `One use only. The model and any unit they are with may re-roll their first failed Break test in the game using an additional D6 and discarding the highest result. Common.`,
